WEBVTT

00:01:38.788 --> 00:01:41.508
Hey, Mo, did you like
the movie, sweetie?

00:01:41.668 --> 00:01:44.268
Well, there was a scene
in the trailer...

00:01:44.468 --> 00:01:46.348
that wasn't in the movie...

00:01:46.508 --> 00:01:48.748
and that makes me sad.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.868
Aw, that's too bad.

00:01:51.068 --> 00:01:52.548
Maybe playing your game
will cheer you up.

00:01:52.628 --> 00:01:53.628
Okay.

00:01:54.988 --> 00:01:56.188
(CHEERFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

00:01:56.268 --> 00:01:57.628
Pancake.

00:01:57.788 --> 00:01:59.108
-Milkshake.
-(CAT MEOWING)

00:01:59.988 --> 00:02:02.508
Pancake.
Pancake.

00:02:03.068 --> 00:02:04.228
Milkshake.

00:02:04.388 --> 00:02:05.788
RALPH: Ooh, ooh, ooh.
I wanna try, I wanna try!

00:02:05.868 --> 00:02:06.948
My turn, my turn!

00:02:07.108 --> 00:02:08.988
Pancake.
Milkshake.

00:02:09.148 --> 00:02:11.348
Milkshake.
Milkshake.

00:02:11.508 --> 00:02:13.188
-(EXCLAIMS SADLY)
-Pancake. Pancake.

00:02:13.348 --> 00:02:15.228
Milkshake.
Milkshake. (CHUCKLES)

00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:17.468
I'm starting to understand
why people like this game.

00:02:17.628 --> 00:02:18.628
Very zen.

00:02:19.028 --> 00:02:20.548
(INHALES, BURPS)

00:02:20.948 --> 00:02:23.308
Hey, everybody,
look what I found!

00:02:23.468 --> 00:02:25.628
-More pancakes!
-RALPH: Sweet!

00:02:25.788 --> 00:02:27.868
Let's speed it up.
Pancake, pancake, pancake.

00:02:28.028 --> 00:02:29.348
Pancake, pancake, pancake.

00:02:29.508 --> 00:02:31.148
Pancake, pancake, pancake.

00:02:31.348 --> 00:02:32.748
Pancake, pancake, pancake.

00:02:33.468 --> 00:02:35.468
Eat, little bunny.
Eat, eat, eat!

00:02:35.748 --> 00:02:37.508
Uh, Ralph, you might wanna try
feeding the kitty

00:02:37.588 --> 00:02:38.908
for a little while.

00:02:39.108 --> 00:02:41.628
No, the kitty gets
the milkshake.

00:02:41.788 --> 00:02:45.628
The bunny gets the pancake.

00:02:49.988 --> 00:02:51.108
(GASPS)

00:02:51.188 --> 00:02:53.628
(RUMBLING)

00:02:53.708 --> 00:02:54.748
(POPS)

00:02:54.828 --> 00:02:56.068
-(SHRIEKING)
-(TIRES SCREECHING)

